      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "DR. LEVIATE (8) jumped from this box and recorded a Grade 4/5 win at Traralgon over 425m latest, scoring by one length (24.22). Has a strong winning record off this same draw including three wins. In winning form and can measure up again. ZIPPING SANDCHEZ (3) made light work of the tricky draw with a fast early sectional but gathered in and had to settle for the minors, finishing second (23.38) at Horsham over 410m. Comes through a solid form race last start. Likely to be in the finish again. LAKEVIEW TRACKER (2) won again in another strong performance after stalking the pace making it three on end, scoring by a long neck (24.57) at this track over 435m. Was a winner at his only start from this draw. In sparkling form and expected to measure up again. GOOD ODDS ROCKY (4) is a last-start placegetter who is in the mix again.",
